===persian===

وقتی قفس شکست...
و... در خاطرِ پرنده...
تصویرِ اوج نقش بست...
موجی به رنگ خواستن آغاز می‌شود
پرهای شوق... در بال‌های تجربه...
بی آن که پرکشد پرواز می‌شود...
بر این مدار...
بی‌دید... بی‌امید...
این‌سان که ما به دستِ دعا سرنهاده‌ایم...
گویی کنارِ هم...
چون میله‌های یک
قفسِ تنگ ایستاده‌ایم...
یک... یک...
جدا... مقابل هم...
جای خنده است... وقتی که یک قفس...
در انتظار معجزهٔ یک پرنده است...
۱۳۷۲

===machine===

When the cage broke...
and... in the bird's memory...
the image of the height took shape...
a wave the colour of wanting begins.
The feathers of longing... in the wings of experience...
without a single beat, become flight...
On this orbit...
sightless... hopeless...
the way we have laid our heads in the hand of prayer...
it is as if side by side...
like the bars of one
narrow cage, we are standing...
one... by one...
apart... facing one another...
It is a thing to laugh at... when a cage...
sits waiting for the miracle of a bird...
1372

===lantern===

When the cage broke,
and in the bird's memory
the image of the height took shape,
a wave the colour of wanting begins.
The feathers of longing, in the wings of experience,
become flight without one beat of a wing...
On this orbit,
sightless, hopeless,
the way we have laid our heads in the hand of prayer —
it is as though we stood side by side
like the bars of one narrow cage,
one by one,
apart, facing each other.
It is a thing to laugh at, when a cage
sits waiting for the miracle of a bird...

1372

===translation===

===footnotes===

The turn comes in the last two lines and reverses everything before it: the bird has been
the one waiting to be freed, and it is the cage that is found waiting for a miracle.
